    //       [PAPER] "a single anchor price p and a single spread s ... Adjusting p and s reprices every level at once"
    //       (e.g. Fig. 1: p 2,457.460 -> 2,457.788, s 1 -> 45 ppm).
    function 0x39c1(uint256 varg0) private {
        require(varg0 < 2, Panic(33)); // failed convertion to enum type
